%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: MonikaAndMaroDealsWithTheDarkBrotherhood
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360592123756636
    - rid: 4972360592123756637
    - rid: 4972360592123756650
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I guess this is <i>the</i> Dragon Bridge.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360592123756638
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I can't believe some punk bandit tried to attack me on the way  here-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360592123756639
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I guess I'm lucky that she was alone and was scared off by just my outfit...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360592123756640
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360592123756641
    - rid: 4972360592123756642
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Excuse me, which building is the Penitus Oculatus' headquarters in?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360592123756643
    - rid: 4972360592123756644
    - rid: 4972360592123756646
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41bdf284be23a1c429ceb699bc93613d, type: 2}
    dialog: You've got business with them?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360592123756647
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41bdf284be23a1c429ceb699bc93613d, type: 2}
    dialog: It's that building right there, the one with the Imperial banners hung
      up on it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Thank you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360592123756648
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360592123756649
    - rid: 4972360592123756651
    - rid: 4972360592123756652
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Haahh... are they just letting anyone in here?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379444
    - rid: 4972360613912379445
    - rid: 4972360613912379446
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Fine, what do you want citizen-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh! That outfit... Aren't you the guard captain of Whiterun?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379447
    - rid: 4972360613912379448
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That's right.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379449
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Well then, what brings you here?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379450
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Actually...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379451
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika recounts her investigation. Again...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379453
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: 'This time with new information from {mc}: the primary suspect is a member
      of the Dark Brotherhood.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379454
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: You say that the Thalmor are employing the Dark Brotherhood, hm?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379455
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Like <i>that's</i> what we need right now, gods...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379456
    - rid: 4972360613912379458
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: You certainly came to the right place-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379457
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: We've actually been investigating the Dark Brotherhood presence in Skyrim
      for a bit now...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379459
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Ever since the alleged death of the Listener just over a decade ago-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: The Brotherhood has, thankfully, been far less active.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: While it's fortunate that less people have to meet an untimely end-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: It does make the job of tracking them down that much harder.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379470
